  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ljtn/epiq/zipball/v1.13.0",
  "body": "v1.13.0\r\n\r\nCommits from other repos\r\n\r\n- Connect other repos to a board; their commits show on the tickets\r\n  they name and in the timeline (4SC2RXY, #450)\r\n- Connecting previews the repo first and asks to confirm (6YXX7VQ, #462)\r\n- The repo list syncs with the board, no commit needed (6YXX7VQ, #462)\r\n- Labels, branch choice and history window per repo (NFJE6KS, #450)\r\n- Local paths are refused: only repos everyone can fetch (VZK650A, #463)\r\n\r\nClones\r\n\r\n- Read-only clones, fetched on sync, capped at 2 GB each (HSH4BSK, #451)\r\n- Interrupted or broken clones recover on their own (E7YXMP6, ACAM1F1,\r\n  #455–#459)\r\n\r\nSettings\r\n\r\n- One settings panel, from the avatar or the gear (9FNQFP3, #460)\r\n\r\nFixes\r\n\r\n- Diffs of a repo's first commit no longer show a git error\r\n(6YXX7VQ,\r\n  #462)\r\n- Writes from a noame machine always show\r\n  (6YXX7VQ, #462)\r\n\r\nInternal\r\n\r\n- Three CI flakes"
